CC0 1.0 Universal — Public Domain Dedication

The packs in this repository are dedicated to the public domain. Everyone who
contributes a pack here waives their copyright and related rights in it, to the
extent allowed by law, so that anyone may copy, modify and distribute it for any
purpose without asking permission or giving credit.

This is what allows the Aloud app to redistribute a pack to every reader who
installs it.

